                    r3_bonus_label:         `And the performance bonus for beating the SLA, within the ±8% band? (% of contract value)`,
                    r3_bonus_readout:       `Bonus for beating the target:`,
                    r3_pct_label2:          `%`,
                    r3_exit_label:          `Do you write a measurable exit / termination trigger so the city is never trapped again?`,
                    sla_measurable:         `Exact metric — ≥98% verified weekly via telemetry, defined cure period, audited monthly`,
                    sla_reasonable:         `Vendor shall use 'best / reasonable efforts' to deliver on time`,
                    sla_annual:             `A single annual delivery average reviewed once at year-end`,
                    exit_triggered:         `Yes — defined breach thresholds, step-in rights and a pre-qualified backup vendor`,
                    exit_discretion:        `A general clause allowing termination 'for cause' at the city's discretion`,
