                    r4_oversight_label:     `Choose how the contract is monitored and governed`,
                    r4_shock_label:         `Shock: week 1 delivery dips to 95% and a losing bidder files a challenge. Your response?`,
                    r4_defence_label:       `Before the mock TCE / Controladoria panel, what is your closing case?`,
                    r4_conviction_label:    `Conviction: how firmly do you argue that agility and accountability are complementary, not opposed? (%)`,
