                    over_inhouse:           `In-house only — manage it with the existing 22 stretched staff, no extra cost`,
                    over_telemetry:         `Telemetry only — the live dashboard will catch everything by itself`,
                    over_thirdparty:        `Independent third-party audit only — outsource all monitoring, no live data`,
                    shock_evidence:         `Trigger the cure period on telemetry evidence and publish the scored matrix to answer the challenge`,
                    shock_ignore:           `Ignore the dip as noise and let the legal team handle the challenge quietly`,
                    shock_dispensa:         `Tear up the award and invoke dispensa emergencial to be safe before the surge`,
